sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Attacker
    participant Client as Legit Client
    participant API as Resource Server API

    rect rgb(255, 245, 245)
    Note over Attacker,API: Bearer token replay
    Client->>API: API request<br/>Authorization: Bearer access_token
    Attacker->>Attacker: Steals bearer access_token
    Attacker->>API: Replays request<br/>Authorization: Bearer stolen token
    API->>Attacker: May accept if token is valid<br/>and no sender constraint exists
    end

    rect rgb(245, 250, 255)
    Note over Attacker,API: DPoP-protected token
    Client->>API: API request<br/>Authorization: DPoP-bound access_token<br/>DPoP proof signed with client's private key
    Attacker->>Attacker: Steals access_token only
    Attacker->>API: Replays token without valid DPoP proof
    API->>Attacker: Rejects request<br/>proof does not match token binding
    end
